{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾受傷病困擾及因體重問題而遭網暴【相關報道】的奧運跳水冠軍全紅嬋再次公開亮相，周日（18日）在上海出席商業活動。</p><p>現場可見她身穿白色服裝，紮起小辮子。</p><p>有網友稱全紅嬋愈來愈漂亮。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T09:58:52.360968+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:35:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:17:44.177989+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:57:35.331490+00:00","content_hash":"dcf6b772e26dadc561778d8a963e68c56fb8dc7575bdceed5b0120ce396dd286","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}